來點了海老雞白湯和豪華雞清湯拉麵\n海老湯頭很鮮很好喝\n麵條比較粗款，沒有提供選擇硬度\n吃起來偏硬口感\n雞清湯則是細麵，可以選擇硬度\n選擇偏硬口感！\n豪華版除了雞叉燒還有豬叉燒、雞肉丸子和海老餛飩\n叉燒都很好吃！豬肉叉燒紋路很美、新鮮沒有豬臭味\n餛飩很好吃～裡面有整隻蝦蝦\n清湯湯頭很有味道，搭配水菜更讚\n店員會主動詢問是否要加麵\n可以半球或一球，不過我們都吃飽了就沒有加\n後面還陸續有人登記候位中\n生意非常非常好！",null,[0,46]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaZW1WV09XMVhTRlV3WXpBNVVHUnRkRzlqUldoSVUyeGtWMlJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaZW1WV09XMVhTRlV3WXpBNVVHUnRkRzlqUldoSVUyeGtWMlJGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaZW1WV09XMVhTRlV3WXpBNVVHUnRkRzlqUldoSVUyeGtWMlJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaZW1WV09XMVhTRlV3WXpBNVVHUnRkRzlqUldoSVUyeGtWMlJGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaZW1WV09XMVhTRlV3WXpBNVVHUnRkRzlqUldoSVUyeGtWMlJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhaZW1WV09XMVhTRlV3WXpBNVVHUnRkRzlqUldoSVUyeGtWMlJGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7440,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xZemVWOW1XSFUwYzA5UGRtdG9jRWhIU2xkV2RFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x3ac14e93ca62dad4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlYzeV9mWHU0c09PdmtocEhHSldWdEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xZemVWOW1XSFUwYzA5UGRtdG9jRWhIU2xkV2RFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xZemVWOW1XSFUwYzA5UGRtdG9jRWhIU2xkV2RFRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xZemVWOW1XSFUwYzA5UGRtdG9jRWhIU2xkV2RFRRILMGRoX1lCOUszbloaPgovQ0F