IzQIHVnQFSAQ3YcHCKIBKAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwjD-IrM9tmWAxVgIzQIHVnQFSAQ3IcHCKEBKBI",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["本來要等一個小時半才可以入座，還好沒有放棄，現場等也沒有離開45鐘就入座了（沒有電話預約喔）。因為帶著7歲小童，詢問服務人員有沒有低消（因為可以免費加麵），他（ㄎㄜ ㄋㄥ ㄕㄉㄧㄢ ㄓㄤ？）很客氣的回答不要有壓力！（加分）我們點了海老雞白湯拉麵，裡面有濃濃的蝦味，光聞到就痛風了！（呵呵）。裡面的雞肉片應該是舒肥方式處理，口感嫩又有texture另外加點了炸蝦餅，真是享受！後面也有可以掛外套的地方！員工對話也可愛，互動很好笑！是個很歡喜的餐廳！好希望有月票然後不用排隊直接入座的服務，哈哈！（吃好飽）",null,[0,90]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHVm1WWFRuQk5WbFYwVkZkd1lWWXdTa3BsUkU1VVRrUnJlRmt4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHVm1WWFRuQk5WbFYwVkZkd1lWWXdTa3BsUkU1VVRrUnJlRmt4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHVm1WWFRuQk5WbFYwVkZkd1lWWXdTa3BsUkU1VVRrUnJlRmt4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHVm1WWFRuQk5WbFYwVkZkd1lWWXdTa3BsUkU1VVRrUnJlRmt4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHVm1WWFRuQk5WbFYwVkZkd1lWWXdTa3BsUkU1VVRrUnJlRmt4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12976888674773215955/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHVm1WWFRuQk5WbFYwVkZkd1lWWXdTa3BsUkU1VVRrUnJlRmt4UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,16833,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGVmVXTnBNVlV0VFdwYVYwSkplRE5UTkRreFkxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x3ac14e93ca62dad4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlFVeWNpMVUtTWpaV0JJeDNTNDkxY1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGVmVXTnBNVlV0VFdwYVYwSkp